llama2.c -- https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c
Copyright (c) 2023 Andrej Karpathy
MIT License (full text in vendor/LICENSE_llama2c)

  vendor/run.c and vendor/runq.c are unmodified upstream copies, kept in the
  tree so the optimization baseline is auditable rather than described.

  src/runq_nf.c is a derivative of vendor/runq.c. The transformer, tokenizer
  and sampler are upstream; NeonForge replaces the matmul call sites with the
  dispatching kernels in src/kernels*.c and adds a batched prefill path plus
  timing instrumentation. Every edit is marked with a "NEONFORGE:" comment.

